ind":"announcement","title":"3 days left in Next Fest — the demo takes 25 minutes","summary":"If The Sixth Sin Demo has been sitting in your library, this is the nudge. Steam Next Fest ends October 26. The demo starts at the beginning of the story and takes about 25–35 minutes: the orphanage, the UV flashlight, the grid inventory, and the voice on the radio that is a little too helpful. The demo stays on Steam after the festival, but if you play it this weekend and tell us what scared you and what annoyed you, it goes straight into the Early Access build. Cem (the one developer) reads ev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T12:21:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036178","verified_at":"2026-10-23T14:47:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4913720-1846651706674546","game_id":"steam-4913720","kind":"update","title":"11 Languages — Full Localisation Update","summary":"The Sixth Sin now speaks 11 languages.English · Türkçe · 简体中文 · Русский · Deutsch · Español ·Français · Português-BR · Italiano · 日本語 · 한국어This isn't a menu-only localisation. Every note, letter, newspaperclipping and radio transmission in the game has been translated —including Mary's letter and Thomas Ward's last night, the two longestand most important texts in the story. If a language is listed, thewhole game is in it.The game now picks your language automatically on first launch, basedon yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T14:52:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674546","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4913720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T0